## Commandment #1 (pointer)

Before changing **player movement**, **health/stamina/oxygen pools**, or **attacks/blocks**, read **`AGENTS.md`** at the repo root and route design-time parameters and logic through **`PlayerMovement`**, **`PlayerVitals`**, and **`PlayerCombat`** respectively (see full table there).

**Commandment #2:** Final assistant replies in this repo must end with the build-label line and a **What’s needed from you** section — see **`.cursor/rules/build-label-chat-footer.mdc`**.
